sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Widget as widget.luau
    participant Panel as panel.luau
    participant Service as service.luau
    participant Agg as DashboardAggregator
    participant GH as GitHubProvider
    participant GL as GitLabProvider
    participant CLI as gh / glab / tea

    User->>Widget: click
    Widget->>Panel: noctalia.togglePanel(id)
    Panel->>Panel: render(All tab from state)

    Note over Service: Timer update() every refresh_interval_sec
    Service->>GH: fetch (isolated)
    Service->>GL: fetch (isolated)
    GH->>CLI: runAsync argv (gh ...)
    GL->>CLI: runAsync argv (glab ...)
    CLI-->>GH: ProviderSnapshot or error
    CLI-->>GL: ProviderSnapshot or error
    GH-->>Agg: snapshot
    GL-->>Agg: snapshot
    Agg->>Agg: merge, capabilities, urgent
    Agg-->>Service: aggregated overview
    Service->>Service: state.set overview/providers/status/urgent
    Service-->>Widget: state.watch urgent
    Service-->>Panel: state.watch overview

    User->>Panel: switch tab / mark / open URL
    Panel->>Service: IPC mark-read provider id
    Service->>GH: mark (if capability)
    GH->>CLI: --mark-notification-read
    Panel->>Panel: xdg-open url via runAsync
